        "text": "Evaluate at each limit.",
        "tex": "F(2) = 4 + 8 - 8 = 4, \\qquad F(-1) = \\frac{1}{4} - 1 + 4 = \\frac{13}{4}"
      },
      {
        "text": "Subtract.",
        "tex": "= 4 - \\frac{13}{4} = \\frac{3}{4}"
      }
