        "tex": "= \\left[8x - \\frac{2x^3}{3}\\right]_0^2 + \\left[\\frac{2x^3}{3} - 8x\\right]_2^3"
      },
      {
        "text": "Substitute the limits.",
        "tex": "= \\left(16 - \\frac{16}{3}\\right) + \\left((18 - 24) - \\left(\\frac{16}{3} - 16\\right)\\right) = \\frac{32}{3} + \\frac{14}{3} = \\frac{46}{3}"
      }
